Nobody said it is the same thing.  Of course it isn't.  It is much more 
difficult to keep things in memory than to write them down.  But just 
taking the simpler route does not make you a cheater.  The question is 
whether the rules of nethack state that you cannot take notes in playing 
it.  They don't.  Not even implicitly.

A better comparison would have been watching a movie, remembering it and 
telling it to your friends with recording it and playing it back.  The 
former can give to them a very lively impression while the latter will 
give them an exact expression.  It is just a matter of degree.  And this 
degree should make the difference between cheating and not cheating?

No, really.

